ose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是差错率（差错件数 ÷ 完成件数），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是容差下限（此线以下不罚），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是归零线。三个参数各自的含义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（容差）承认了&quot;零差错不可能&quot;。设为零会让所有员工长期被罚，质量因子失去区分度。容差通常设在团队中位差错率附近，让一半人在此线以内。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（归零线）是&quot;不可接受&quot;的边界，设在这一线的人当月奖金归零。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 决定斜率。斜率太陡，容差附近波动造成巨大收入差异；太缓，质量不构成约束。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>乘入式的一个直接推论：<strong>高产者受质量约束更重</strong>。同样是 1% 的差错率，产量高的人绝对差错数更多，如果差错率按绝对数而非比率算，高产者会被系统性惩罚，理性策略就变成压低产量。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 必须用<strong>比率</strong>而非绝对数，这条看似平凡的要求在实际系统中经常被违反——因为按绝对数统计更容易实现。</p>\n<h3 id=\"考核周期必须匹配信号延迟\">考核周期必须匹配信号延迟</h3><p>质量信号的延迟决定考核周期。如果差错的平均发现延迟是八天，那么以&quot;日&quot;为周期考核质量就是在考核噪声，以&quot;月&quot;为周期才包含完整信号。但月度考核的激励太滞后，员工当月的行为到下个月才知道后果。</p>\n<p>可行的解法是<strong>分层周期</strong>：用&quot;疑似差错信号&quot;（如打包称重与预期重量不符）做日度的即时提醒与自查，用&quot;确认差错&quot;（客户投诉、退货核验）做月度的正式考核。前者不罚钱只提醒（纠正行为），后者罚钱（承担责任）。这个分层把&quot;及时纠偏&quot;与&quot;公平问责&quot;分开了。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[打包称重偏差&lt;br/&gt;T+0 即时] --&gt; B[疑似差错&lt;br/&gt;日度提醒]&#10;  B --&gt; C[打包员自查]&#10;  C --&gt; D[若已发出&lt;br/&gt;进入观察]&#10;  E[客户投诉&lt;br/&gt;T+5~T+10] --&gt; F[确认差错]&#10;  F --&gt; G[回溯归因]&#10;  G --&gt; H[月度质量考核]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  H --&gt; I[质量因子]&#10;  I --&gt; J[奖金结算]&#10;  B --&gt; K[不罚钱&lt;br/&gt;仅纠偏]&#10;  H --&gt; L[罚钱&lt;br/&gt;正式问责]\">graph TD\n  A[打包称重偏差&lt;br/&gt;T+0 即时] --&gt; B[疑似差错&lt;br/&gt;日度提醒]\n  B --&gt; C[打包员自查]\n  C --&gt; D[若已发出&lt;br/&gt;进入观察]\n  E[客户投诉&lt;br/&gt;T+5~T+10] --&gt; F[确认差错]\n  F --&gt; G[回溯归因]\n  G --&gt; H[月度质量考核]\n  D --&gt; F\n  H --&gt; I[质量因子]\n  I --&gt; J[奖金结算]\n  B --&gt; K[不罚钱&lt;br/&gt;仅纠偏]\n  H --&gt; L[罚钱&lt;br/&gt;正式问责]</pre><h2 id=\"采集质量数据的工程实现\">采集质量数据的工程实现</h2><p>质量数据来自两个源：内部发现（复核、称重、质检抽检）与外部反馈（客户投诉、退货）。两者必须能合并到同一个员工维度上，这需要一个把外部单据映射回内部任务的关联结构。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 质量事件表：把内外部信号合并到任务与责任人&#10;CREATE TABLE quality_event (&#10;  event_id       BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  order_id       BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  task_id        BIGINT,                -- 回溯到的拣货/打包任务&#10;  assignee_id    BIGINT,                -- 责任人，无法归因时为 NULL&#10;  source         VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,  -- internal_check|customer_claim|return_qc&#10;  defect_type    VARCHAR(24) NOT NULL,  -- wrong_item|missing|extra|damaged&#10;  detected_at    TIMESTAMP NOT NULL,&#10;  order_shipped_at TIMESTAMP,           -- 用于计算发现延迟&#10;  severity       VARCHAR(8),            -- minor|major|critical&#10;  attributable   BOOLEAN NOT NULL,      -- 是否可归因到个人&#10;  evidence       JSONB                  -- 扫描记录/称重差异/照片引用&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_qe_assignee ON quality_event (assignee_id, detected_at)&#10;  WHERE attributable;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_qe_order ON quality_event (order_id);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 质量事件表：把内外部信号合并到任务与责任人</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> quality_event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  event_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  task_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 回溯到的拣货/打包任务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  assignee_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 责任人，无法归因时为 NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- internal_check|customer_claim|return_qc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  defect_type    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- wrong_item|missing|extra|damaged</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  detected_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_shipped_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 用于计算发现延迟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  severity       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- minor|major|critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  attributable   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 是否可归因到个人</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence       JSONB                  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 扫描记录/称重差异/照片引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_qe_assignee</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quality_event (assignee_id, detected_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attributable;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_qe_order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quality_event (order_id);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>order_shipped_at</code> 与 <code>detected_at</code> 的差就是发现延迟，它是选择考核周期的直接依据——先测出你所在仓库的延迟分布，再定周期。<code>attributable</code> 这个布尔字段把前面表格里&quot;可归因性&quot;的判断固化进数据，让考核查询可以简单地按它过滤，而不是在业务代码里散落判断规则。<code>evidence</code> 用 JSONB 而不是多个字段，因为扫描记录、称重数据、照片的结构各不相同且可能演进。</p>\n<p>需要注意的隐私边界：<code>evidence</code> 里不应默认存放客户个人信息（姓名、地址、联系方式），质量归因只需要订单号与商品信息。把客户数据写进绩效相关的表里，会让绩效系统意外成为个人数据的另一个副本，扩大泄露面。这一原则与 <a href=\"../scheduling-labor-capacity/multilingual-frontline-attendance\">多语种一线员工/缺勤/离职管理</a> 中关于员工数据最小化的讨论是同一条。</p>\n<h2 id=\"防止反向扭曲-过度强调质量\">防止反向扭曲：过度强调质量</h2><p>质量因子设计得过头，会引发另一个方向的扭曲：员工为了零差错而放慢速度、拒绝接复杂任务、甚至把难处理的订单标记为异常推给别人。识别这类行为的信号是：个体差错率极低但产出也显著低于团队，或异常上报率异常高。</p>\n<p>反向扭曲的防御是让质量因子在容差内保持平坦——不要把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 设得太低（接近零），也不要让斜率太陡。质量考核的目标是&quot;把差错控制在可接受水平&quot;，不是&quot;追求零差错&quot;。零差错在人工拣货里不是可达目标，追求它只会把成本从差错转移到迟滞。</p>\n<p>一个实用的校准方法是：定期检查&quot;差错率最低的 10% 员工&quot;的产出水平。如果这批人的产出显著低于团队中位，说明质量压力过大；如果接近或高于中位，说明质量与速度尚未真正冲突，质量因子是有效的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>张力来自时间与归属的不对称</strong>：速度收益即时且归个人，质量成本滞后且归组织。</li>\n<li><strong>归因链路是质量考核的地基</strong>，不是扣减规则。强制扫描是让归因可规模化的唯一实用手段。</li>\n<li><strong>必要动作（扫描、复核）必须计入标准工时</strong>，否则员工绕过它保效率，制度形同虚设。</li>\n<li><strong>可归因性决定考核方式</strong>：可归因进个人绩效，不可归因进团队或流程指标；强行归因损害体系正当性。</li>\n<li><strong>质量因子乘入奖金而非扣减</strong>，用<strong>比率</strong>而非绝对数，否则高产者被系统性惩罚。</li>\n<li><strong>容差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 承认零差错不可能</strong>；追求零差错会把成本从差错转移到迟滞。</li>\n<li><strong>考核周期必须匹配信号延迟</strong>：分层为日度纠偏（不罚钱）与月度问责（罚钱）。</li>\n<li><strong>质量数据表不应默认存放客户个人信息</strong>，归因只需订单与商品维度。</li>\n<li>奖金结构与加班基数见 <a href=\"piece-rate-hourly-incentive-pay\">计件/计时/绩效工资设计</a>；差错信号如何进入个人排名见 <a href=\"individual-picker-productivity\">个人拣货绩效与排名公平性</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"速度与差错/质量的平衡考核","id":"速度与差错-质量的平衡考核"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"建立差错归因链路","id":"建立差错归因链路"},{"level":3,"text":"扫码是归因的地基","id":"扫码是归因的地基"},{"level":3,"text":"差错的分类与可归因性","id":"差错的分类与可归因性"},{"level":2,"text":"质量因子的设计","id":"质量因子的设计"},{"level":3,"text":"乘入而非扣减","id":"乘入而非扣减"},{"level":3,"text":"考核周期必须匹配信号延迟","id":"考核周期必须匹配信号延迟"},{"level":2,"text":"采集质量数据的工程实现","id":"采集质量数据的工程实现"},{"level":2,"text":"防止反向扭曲：过度强调质量","id":"防止反向扭曲-过度强调质量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"个人拣货绩效与排名公平性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-labor-pick-incentive-safety/incentive-productivity/individual-picker-productivity"},"next":{"title":"班次排班与工时/加班合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-labor-pick-incentive-safety/scheduling-labor-capacity/shift-roster-labor-law"}}